## Data ownership and migrations

- PostgreSQL is the system of record unless a section below explicitly names a
  different owner.
- `backend/migrations` owns ordered Liquibase changesets with direct
  preconditions. Application startup applies the master changelog.
- JPA identifiers use `Long`; schema identifiers use `BIGINT`; unbounded text
  uses PostgreSQL `TEXT`.

