## Observability and operations

- Structured application logs go to stdout and carry a correlation ID.
- Actuator exposes health and Prometheus metrics.
- Outbound calls use low-cardinality metrics and explicit timeouts.
- HTTP logging is metadata-only in production and masks sensitive values.

